    "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/opinion/open-page/the-ripple-effect-of-change/article71653616.ece",
    "title": "The ripple effect of change",
    "subtitle": null,
    "author": "J. Clement Selvaraj",
    "published_at": null,
    "image_url": null,
    "image_caption": null,
    "content_html": "<div class=\"articlebodycontent col-xl-9 col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-12\" id=\"content-body-71653616\"><div class=\"schemaDiv\" id=\"schemaDiv\"><p><span class=\"drop-caps\">S</span>ome time ago, I bought a premium pair of jeans which came with a leather belt as free gift. The belt looked elegant, somewhat cowboyish, and its colour was somewhere between brown and maroon, a shade I had never seen on a belt before. I liked it so much that it soon created another requirement. I needed a pair of shoes that would go well with the belt. After some searching, I found a pair in a mall. The shoes came with a few pairs of matching socks and polish. Thus, one purchase quietly led to another, and then another. Unfortunately, the shoes were not as comfortable as my usual pairs, and after a few attempts to wear them, they ended up in a corner of my shoe rack.</p><p>My wife recently went through something similar. She brought home a beautiful indoor plant and wanted to place it on the landing of our staircase. The plant was fine, but the pot had to match the colour of the tiles and the wall. She searched through one online store after another, but could not find what she considered the perfect pot. Finally, a friend recommended a shop in town. We went there and found a beautiful collection of flower pots, vases, and other decorative things. We returned home with a cartload of them, most of which are now resting peacefully in our storeroom, waiting for their turn.</p></div><div class=\"articleblock-container\" id=\"arthardpv\"></div><div class=\"update-publish-time article-published-time-end\"><p class=\"publish-time-new\"> Published <span>- November 08, 2026 03:35 am IST</span></p></div><div class=\"comments-shares share-page flex print-hide\" data-artid=\"71653616\" data-title=\"The ripple effect of change\" data-url=\"https://www.thehindu.com/opinion/open-page/the-ripple-effect-of-change/article71653616.ece\"><div class=\"left\"><div class=\"share\"><button class=\"btn share-btn\" data-ga-labelclick=\"ArticleShare\"></button><ul class=\"share-list bottom\" style=\"display: none;\"><li class=\"copy-link\" data-cf-modified-29863fb250501b68909c19b7-=\"\" onclick=\"if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; copytext('https://www.thehindu.com/opinion/open-page/the-ripple-effect-of-change/article71653616.ece');\">\n                Copy link  \n                        \n            </li><li class=\"email\"><a href=\"mailto:?subject=The%20ripple%20effect%20of%20change&amp;amp;body=Check%20out%20this%20link%20https%3A%2F%2Fwww.thehindu.com%2Fopinion%2Fopen-page%2Fthe-ripple-effect-of-change%2Farticle71653616.ece\" target=\"_self\">\n                    Email     \n                                \n                </a></li><li class=\"facebook\" data-cf-modified-29863fb250501b68909c19b7-=\"\" onclick=\"if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; openShareLink('https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.thehindu.com%2Fopinion%2Fopen-page%2Fthe-ripple-effect-of-change%2Farticle71653616.ece&amp;t=The%20ripple%20effect%20of%20change')\">\n                Facebook   \n                        \n            </li><li class=\"twitter\" data-cf-modified-29863fb250501b68909c19b7-=\"\" onclick=\"if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; openShareLink('https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.thehindu.com%2Fopinion%2Fopen-page%2Fthe-ripple-effect-of-change%2Farticle71653616.ece&amp;text=The%20ripple%20effect%20of%20change')\">\n                Twitter    \n                        \n            </li><li class=\"telegram\" data-cf-modified-29863fb250501b68909c19b7-=\"\" onclick=\"if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; openShareLink('https://t.me/share/url?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.thehindu.com%2Fopinion%2Fopen-page%2Fthe-ripple-effect-of-change%2Farticle71653616.ece&amp;text=The%20ripple%20effect%20of%20change')\">\n                Telegram     \n                        \n        